    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "24. Core Abilities",
    "ruleNumber": "24.04",
    "summary": "A unit with at least one model carrying an [ASSAULT] weapon may use the Assault Shooting type (10.05). The ability does nothing more by itself: Assault Shooting is open only to a unit that is unengaged and Advanced this turn, and it limits that unit to its [ASSAULT] weapons.",
